},"ordering_evidence":"guanzhang-e-o028c-q","source_order":[36,114,"O028c"],"order":6891}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0015","name":"韦康","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o028","xunyu-q-p016","xiahoucao-q-o014","xinyang-q-4bc0320bd18737c83bca","xinyang-q-31655c952d9b6b571884","xinyang-q-33c2ef720c82de5d13e6"],"facts":[{"id":"xunyu-f0009","label":"字","text":"元将","evidence":["xunyu-f0009-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"元将","evidence":["xunyu-f0009-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"guanzhang-m-o028-guanzhang-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o028"]},{"id":"xunyu-m-p016-guanzhang-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-p016"]},{"id":"xunyu-m-o014-guanzhang-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-o014"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o014-guanzhang-p0015","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o014"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-e-o028c-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-821dc0e40ab6f1b50f39","layer":"original","quote":"超果率诸戎以击陇上郡县，陇上郡县皆应之；杀凉州刺史韦康，据冀城〖14〗，有其众；超自称征西将军，领并州牧，督凉州军事。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":111,"end":170},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o028","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-821dc0e40ab6f1b50f39","layer":"original","quote":"曹公用贾诩谋〖10〗，离间超、遂，更相猜疑；军以大败，﹝二﹞超走保诸戎。曹公追至安定，会北方有事，引军东还。杨阜说曹公曰〖11〗：“超有信、布之勇〖12〗，甚得羌胡心。若大军还，不严为其备，陇上诸郡非国家之有也〖13〗。”超果率诸戎以击陇上郡县，陇上郡县皆应之；杀凉州刺史韦康，据冀城〖14〗，有其众；超自称征西将军，领并州牧，督凉州军事。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":170},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"马超围凉州刺史韦康于冀〖3〗，渊救康；未到，康败。去冀二百余里，超来逆战。军不利。汧氐反，渊引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":85,"end":135},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o014","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"与太祖会安定，降杨秋。十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。马超围凉州刺史韦康于冀〖3〗，渊救康；未到，康败。去冀二百余里，超来逆战。军不利。汧氐反，渊引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135},{"id":"xinyang-q-31655c952d9b6b571884","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-35f1226dab0503bd3b22","layer":"pei","quote":"及超攻急，城中饥困；刺史韦康素仁，愍吏民伤残，欲与超和。昂谏不听，归以语异，异曰：‘君有争臣，大夫有专利之义：专不为非也。焉知救兵不到关陇哉？当共勉卒高勋，全节致死，不可从也！’比昂还，康与超和。","attribution":"裴注·皇甫谧列女传","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7ab6316d3e38e1652aa4","start":336,"end":434},{"id":"xinyang-q-33c2ef720c82de5d13e6","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-35f1226dab0503bd3b22","layer":"pei","quote":"超遂背约害康，又劫昂，质其嫡子月于南郑。欲要昂以为己用，然心未甚信。","attribution":"裴注·皇甫谧列女传","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":175,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7ab6316d3e38e1652aa4","start":434,"end":468},{"id":"xinyang-q-4bc0320bd18737c83bca","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-11673b0d891298201a99","layer":"original","quote":"而端征为太仆。其子康代为刺史，辟阜为别驾。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":10,"end":31},{"id":"xunyu-e-p016b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-d13a86f6c866d38264d4","layer":"pei","quote":"端从凉州牧征为太仆，康代为凉州刺史，时人荣之。后为马超所围，坚守历时；救军不至，遂为超所杀。","attribution":"裴注述及孔融书","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-41f82e7b36f1dab6010f","start":81,"end":127},{"id":"xunyu-f0009-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-d13a86f6c866d38264d4","layer":"pei","quote":"康字元将","attribution":"裴注述及孔融书","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-41f82e7b36f1dab6010f","start":0,"end":4},{"id":"xunyu-q-o014","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-9ae5af5eea55486407f3","layer":"original","quote":"太祖问彧：“谁能代卿为我谋者？”言彧：“荀攸、钟繇。”先是，彧言策谋士，进戏志才；志才卒，又进郭嘉：太祖以彧为知人。诸所进达，皆称职；唯严象为扬州，韦康为凉州，后败亡。﹝三﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87},{"id":"xunyu-q-p016","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-d13a86f6c866d38264d4","layer":"pei","quote":"康字元将，亦京兆人。孔融与康父端书曰：“前日元将来。渊才亮茂，雅度弘毅，伟世之器也。昨日仲将又来。懿性贞实，文敏笃诚，保家之主也。不意双珠，近出老蚌。甚珍贵之！”端从凉州牧征为太仆，康代为凉州刺史，时人荣之。后为马超所围，坚守历时；救军不至，遂为超所杀。","attribution":"裴注述及孔融书","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-41f82e7b36f1dab6010f","start":0,"end":127}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
